\f0\fs24 \cf0 Flow with the Future: Automation with Copilot IA - First Picture\
BAU problem statement - Use case 1 (structured XML reports)\
a) Task / process\
Daily receive two structured XML report types, import them into Excel to read them, manually check for exceptions (e.g., a specific field must not fall below 90), save the evidence, email the summary to a distribution list, and archive the email in DMS.\
b) Frequency\
Daily.\
c) Current pain point\
Manual and repetitive (~30-40 minutes/day). Error risk from XML\uc0\u8594 Excel import and manual filtering/checks (missing an exception, checking the wrong field/version, inconsistent outputs). Extra operational risk if steps like archiving are missed.\
d) Expected impact if improved\
Python + Al/Copilot could parse XML directly, apply the rules, generate a standardized exception report (Excel/PDF) and draft the email for approval. Impact: major time savings, higher consistency/auditability, and reduced risk.}